  "speech": [],
  "notes": "Person boxes drafted by Claude from one frame per second plus the last frame; reviewed by eduardo on 2026-11-15 against an overlay of every keyframe. Shot from behind on a busy street; 720p. Everyone at least about 10% of the frame height is boxed; smaller, far-off figures are not (a detector that finds them is scored as a false positive). Partly hidden people are boxed by their visible part. Foreground boxes (m1, m2) are tight; passer-by boxes are rougher, and passer-by ids across seconds are best guesses (scores match boxes per moment, so a wrong id doesn't change them). m1: maroon hoodie, large black backpack. m2: grey top, glasses, black leather backpack. w1: striped top, auburn hair, small backpack. d1: dark coat, white hair. L: bald, teal shirt, red backpack. N: blonde, behind m2. A, B, C, D, E, G (cyclist), H, J, K: passers-by."
}
